overwhelmed. You're simply overwhelmed. And

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:42.200
when we're overwhelmed, in that state, that's
when you either increase your identity as

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:47.210
a leader, you stay the same, or you go lower.
It's very simple. So when you're overwhelmed,

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:50.090
