00:04:39.909 --> 00:04:45.689
you go do it. And then that's a habit, on
what you do in that moment. That's a habit

00:04:45.689 --> 00:04:49.991
on what you do in that moment. That's the
overwhelm part. The good news is, yes, you're

00:04:49.991 --> 00:04:53.669
overwhelmed. If you can get through the overwhelming
